WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.060
You win often and still lose money? Then your risk-reward is off.

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:11.100
Risk-reward: potential profit divided by your risk.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:16.320
Five dollars risk, ten dollars reward: a one-to-two ratio.

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:20.700
Only four winners out of ten – and still in profit.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:24.510
Below one-to-two? Skip the trade.

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:28.970
Common mistake: moving the target until it fits.

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:34.450
I share setups like this live in my free group. Comment GOLD.
